OL,3,GNEWSAFree haircuts project aims to
OL,4,Ainspire other stylists
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hair stylist from Ringwood is hoping
OL,7,Fto inspire other hairdressers across
OL,8,Fthe country to offer free haircuts.
OL,10,FA few years ago, Georgia Chappels found
OL,11,Fherself in a 'financial crisis' after
OL,12,Fgoing through a divorce. She relied on
OL,13,Ffoodbanks and charities to support her
OL,14,Ffamily.
OL,16,FNow she runs the Community Haircuts
OL,17,Fproject in Hampshire - offering a free,
OL,18,Fdrop-in service with no questions
OL,19,Fasked.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
